@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Worldwide Insured Shipping Policy — SAT Jewel";
}

<div class="sat-legal-page-wrap">
    <!-- Header Banner -->
    <div class="sat-legal-banner">
        <div class="sat-legal-banner-inner">
            <span class="sat-legal-badge">Logistics & Protection</span>
            <h1 class="sat-legal-title">Worldwide Insured Shipping Policy</h1>
            <p class="sat-legal-subtitle">Comprehensive delivery protocols, complimentary armored courier transit, dispatch schedules, and tracking guidelines.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sat-legal-container">

        <!-- 100% Insured Delivery -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card hero-highlight">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved gold-icon"></i> 100% Complimentary Armored Insurance</h2>
            <p>Every fine jewelry commission created by SAT Jewel is shipped via priority armored courier (FedEx Priority, UPS Air, or DHL Express) with full transit insurance. Your valuable piece is 100% protected against transit loss or damage from the moment it leaves our atelier until an adult signature is collected at your doorstep.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Production & Dispatch Timelines -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock gold-icon"></i> Handcrafting & Dispatch Timelines</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>In-Stock Solitaires:</strong> Inspected, laser-engraved, and dispatched within <strong>2 to 4 business days</strong>.</li>
                <li><strong>Bespoke & Custom Castings:</strong> Handcrafted to your exact specifications within <strong>7 to 14 business days</strong> prior to armored dispatch.</li>
                <li><strong>Express USA Delivery:</strong> 3 to 5 business days transit time following courier handover.</li>
                <li><strong>International Delivery:</strong> 5 to 8 business days across Canada, UK, Australia, and Western Europe.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Adult Signature Required -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-signature gold-icon"></i> Adult Signature Requirement</h2>
            <p>For your security, all SAT Jewel deliveries strictly require an adult signature upon delivery. Couriers are instructed never to leave packages unattended at doors, porches, or mailboxes. Please ensure an adult recipient is available at the provided delivery address on the estimated delivery date.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tracking & Communication -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast gold-icon"></i> Live Tracking & Notifications</h2>
            <p>As soon as your shipment is booked with the courier, you will receive an automated dispatch notification with your official AWB tracking number, direct carrier URL, and estimated delivery date via email and SMS/WhatsApp. You can also view active order milestones at any time in your <a href="/Account/MyAccount?tab=orders">Buyer Account Sanctuary</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Support -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset gold-icon"></i> Logistics Assistance & Concierge</h2>
            <p>Have special delivery instructions or need to hold your package at an official FedEx/UPS secure pickup location? Contact our dedicated concierge team at <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com">satjewels31@gmail.com</a> or via WhatsApp concierge at +91 81282 91686.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
